hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"137","Narrated by Muhammad bin Yahya, narrated by Yaqoub bin Ibrahim bin Saeed, narrated by Ubi, on the authority of Muhammad bin Ishaq, who said: He mentioned Muhammad bin Muslim bin Ubaid. Allah bin Shihab Al-Zuhri, on the authority of Urwa, on the authority of Aisha, who said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “The virtue of prayer that is performed in a pure manner.” For the prayer that cannot be performed, it will be rewarded seventy times.” Abu Bakr said: I excluded the authenticity of this news because I am afraid that Muhammad bin Ishaq did not hear from Muhammad bin Muslim. Rather, he misled him from it"
